// g-bootstrap-shorthand-body-keyword-before-tag-cascades: `let <b/>` in a `:`-shorthand state-child body.
<program>
    type Phase:enum = { Idle, Busy }
    <phase:Phase=.Idle single>
        <Idle rule=.Busy : let <b/>>
        <Busy rule=.Idle/>
    </>
    <main>
        <p><*phase/></p>
    </main>
</program>
